                "description": "The beautiful ornate design of this Emtek knobset is as elaborate as it is elegant; even though it is made from solid brass, the Lancaster Knobset seems almost delicate, a perfect finishing touch for any historic home. The Ornate Lancaster Door Knob with Lancaster Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
